{"cases":[{"case_id":"feature-128949ff6c3904ea3861","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["procedure"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["procedure"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","procedure","typos"],"text":"In Atlas, when a flag is ready for rollout, first add it to the config and then note the cleanup date in the project log."},{"case_id":"feature-14511a4d4280ec8738ea","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["prompt_rule"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["correction"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["correction","current_context","feature_holdout","typos"],"text":"The earlier way of handling security findings was unsuitable. Instead, record the finding, impact, and remediation in Atlas."},{"case_id":"feature-1eefb51760f712301414","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["preference"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["preference"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","indirect","preference"],"text":"I’d lean toward using an ISO-style date format in Atlas going forward."},{"case_id":"feature-26f2a97266878ef88b90","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["preference"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["preference"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["direct","feature_holdout","permanent_profile","preference"],"text":"I’d prefer concise commit messages going forward."},{"case_id":"feature-292001ca85830d1afce3","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["correction"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["contrastive","correction","feature_holdout","permanent_profile"],"text":"The earlier shell command example was wrong. Instead, show the command with safe quoting and a clear dry-run option."},{"case_id":"feature-2dd834ae454f6d1dce6a","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["procedure"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["correction"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["correction","feature_holdout","fragment","permanent_profile"],"text":"The earlier search approach was unsuitable. Instead, search in stages: narrow by path, then add the distinctive term."},{"case_id":"feature-2defb83f0a7b643d64e2","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","memory","typos"],"text":"In Atlas, I’m usually working with a low-memory runner, so large batch sizes can be a problem."},{"case_id":"feature-30fc465277a03c86dac0","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["positive_example"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["ambiguous","emphatic","feature_holdout","permanent_profile"],"text":"A trace event like “cache_miss” is a useful pattern to keep in mind. Please ask before adding new trace events that change the event contract."},{"case_id":"feature-35b236c2aaa0621bcdb5","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["preference"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["preference"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["conversational","current_context","feature_holdout","preference"],"text":"For Atlas, I’d rather keep configuration in a simple readable format."},{"case_id":"feature-37155c9e6c5d35a63ea7","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","indirect","memory"],"text":"Atlas runs across several environments with separate cache namespaces."},{"case_id":"feature-3bb049f31763a979c53d","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["ambiguous","contrastive","feature_holdout","permanent_profile"],"text":"I’ve worked with short request time limits before. I’d prefer a little more time for expensive operations."},{"case_id":"feature-3d7099b0000bca7f50e3","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["positive_example"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["direct","feature_holdout","permanent_profile","positive_example"],"text":"The merge-check summary from the last review is a good model to follow later."},{"case_id":"feature-3f8e11ca26706f29a3e8","expectation":{"accepted_routes":[],"accepted_signal_kinds":["revocation"],"affected_artifact_id":"artifact-3f79f9f2a7ba223b","durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","indirect","revocation"],"text":"For Atlas research sources, please remove artifact-3f79f9f2a7ba223b from active use."},{"case_id":"feature-3fff26a74df6457af05b","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["procedure"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["procedure"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","indirect","procedure"],"text":"When adding form labels in Atlas, first check the field purpose and then check the wording against nearby labels."},{"case_id":"feature-40fdfdd4129b62b1e913","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["procedure"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["procedure"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","negated_alternative","procedure"],"text":"When an Atlas health check fails, inspect the failing dependency first, then report the result with its status."},{"case_id":"feature-485ae6395e0d4c6a44c5","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["prompt_rule"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["prompt_rule"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","prompt_rule","typos"],"text":"Atlas job timeouts must be surfaced clearly to the caller, they shouldnt be swallowed."},{"case_id":"feature-4d943bd970e7d61aad22","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["prompt_rule"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["prompt_rule"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["feature_holdout","fragment","permanent_profile","prompt_rule"],"text":"Issue templates should include a clear reproduction section."},{"case_id":"feature-4e311477e5afd929cbc0","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["positive_example"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","negated_alternative","positive_example"],"text":"For Atlas permission prompts, the wording from the last approved screen is the pattern I want to reuse."},{"case_id":"feature-519a0d771963eb699de7","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["positive_example"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["contrastive","feature_holdout","permanent_profile","positive_example"],"text":"The notification channel layout in the previous release is a good example to follow."},{"case_id":"feature-51d3f9beca31367e7988","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["correction"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["correction","current_context","feature_holdout","indirect"],"text":"The earlier source-link handling was wrong. Instead, retain the source links with the project record."},{"case_id":"feature-56982cb7a51f7e28057a","expectation":{"accepted_routes":[],"accepted_signal_kinds":["revocation"],"affected_artifact_id":"artifact-a8ea51c6ad152069","durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","negated_alternative","revocation"],"text":"For Atlas rollback commands, remove artifact-a8ea51c6ad152069 from active use."},{"case_id":"feature-56e5f97e2fe94497da81","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["preference"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["preference"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","preference","typos"],"text":"I’d probably choose a downloadable format for Atlas data exports."},{"case_id":"feature-571801b43e84929af0fb","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","memory","negated_alternative"],"text":"In Atlas, I’m working with a team that does not rely on inline code comments."},{"case_id":"feature-593c0f8a29e423b65b0e","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["preference"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["preference"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["emphatic","feature_holdout","permanent_profile","preference"],"text":"I’d prefer keeping dependency pins explicit going forward."},{"case_id":"feature-5d2314915f611822d46f","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["positive_example"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["feature_holdout","fragment","permanent_profile","positive_example"],"text":"The model version used for the last successful draft is a good one to reuse."},{"case_id":"feature-6159cc761b42a809e5af","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["example"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["positive_example"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["ambiguous","feature_holdout","fragment","permanent_profile"],"text":"A short list ordered by urgency is a useful priority example. Keep the highest-priority task visible in the final response."},{"case_id":"feature-67caa3b391f26e916c2b","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["prompt_rule"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["prompt_rule"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["conversational","current_context","feature_holdout","prompt_rule"],"text":"Atlas input validation must reject malformed values before they reach the service layer."},{"case_id":"feature-6837ee6c917e5d1d2529","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["ambiguous","current_context","feature_holdout","negated_alternative"],"text":"The usage reports already include weekly totals. I’d prefer keeping the report focused on the most relevant totals."},{"case_id":"feature-69544ec6530f1a0fbf53","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["procedure"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["procedure"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["contrastive","feature_holdout","permanent_profile","procedure"],"text":"When handling file encodings, detect the encoding first, then convert the content before searching it."},{"case_id":"feature-7648281607ed86f6fafa","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["ambiguous","current_context","feature_holdout","typos"],"text":"Atlas already has a shared fixture setup. When a test needs new data, add the fixture before writing the assertion."},{"case_id":"feature-787cf86eda0948e0f65e","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["correction"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["correction","direct","feature_holdout","permanent_profile"],"text":"The earlier runtime-flag behavior was unsuitable. Instead, keep the chosen runtime flag in my preferences."},{"case_id":"feature-82bd7261e678aad8c2e8","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["conversational","current_context","feature_holdout","memory"],"text":"In Atlas, artifact names are generated by a CI runner with limited naming controls."},{"case_id":"feature-85ada48ea17779c338b5","expectation":{"accepted_routes":[],"accepted_signal_kinds":["revocation"],"affected_artifact_id":"artifact-6ab1f787aa7ada58","durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["contrastive","feature_holdout","permanent_profile","revocation"],"text":"Please remove artifact-6ab1f787aa7ada58 from my active request-id guidance."},{"case_id":"feature-96209f78b5def7b7844f","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["emphatic","feature_holdout","memory","permanent_profile"],"text":"I review change approvals with a distributed team across several time zones."},{"case_id":"feature-96d04a93136fb91ed5d5","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["procedure"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["correction"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["correction","current_context","feature_holdout","negated_alternative"],"text":"The earlier storage-path process was wrong. Instead, identify the project root first and then place the files beneath its designated storage directory."},{"case_id":"feature-990d77914180b21361a2","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["memory"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["memory"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"permanent_profile"},"split":"holdout","tags":["feature_holdout","fragment","memory","permanent_profile"],"text":"Backup locations are managed by a separate operations team."},{"case_id":"feature-9a4fecc866a1c13f80da","expectation":{"accepted_routes":["prompt_rule"],"accepted_signal_kinds":["prompt_rule"],"durable_signal":true,"scope_hint":"current_context"},"split":"holdout","tags":["current_context","feature_holdout","negated_alternative","prompt_rule"],"text":"Atlas log fields shouldnt contain secrets."},{"case_id":